          blockDesign: "90-degree V6 aluminum block with an open-deck design, Siamesed cast-iron cylinder liners, and a centrally integrated balance shaft driven by the timing chain to reduce inherent V6 primary vibrations. The M272.960 is the larger 3.5L variant of the M272 family, offering increased displacement through a longer stroke and slightly larger bore than the 2.5L variant. It is mechanically identical in all dimensions and hard parts between European and North American calibrations.",
