              "Piston and Ring Stress: The revised facelift pistons are stronger, but prolonged low-octane fuel or severe detonation can still damage ring lands.",
              "Thermostat and Cooling System Aging: Higher thermal throughput demands more from the cooling system. Plastic components age out on the same schedule.",
