                  "Parts and Specialist Availability: Balance shaft replacement is not a general garage job; it requires Mercedes-specific expertise and tools.",
                  "Thermal Stress: The high 11.1:1 compression ratio and DOHC heads generate significant heat, demanding excellent cooling system health.",
                  "Market Value Trap: A cheap CLK 280 often conceals a looming four-figure balance shaft bill that transforms a bargain into a liability."
