                  "7G-Tronic Conductor Plate and Speed Sensor Failure: Y3/8n1 and Y3/8n2 sensor failure causes limp mode.",
                  "7G-Tronic Mechatronic Sleeve Leaks: Fluid leaks through the electrical connector into the transmission.",
