                  "Engine Mount Collapse: The heavy V8 destroys hydraulic mounts quickly, transmitting severe vibration.",
                  "HFM (Hot Film Mass) Sensor Failure: Contamination causes hesitation and mixture faults.",
                  "Oil Cooler Leaks: The oil-to-coolant heat exchanger leaks at gaskets with age.",
                  "Intake Manifold Gasket Oil Leak: Oil leaks past the intake manifold gasket.",
                  "Cooling System Aging: Expansion tanks, water pumps, thermostats, and hoses fail. The large V8 generates significant heat.",
