                  "VVT Solenoid and Camshaft Adjuster Failure: Oil-pressure-dependent actuators on all four camshafts become sluggish, noisy, or fault-code-prone with degraded oil.",
                  "Variable Intake Manifold (VIM) Carbon Buildup and Actuator Failure: Carbon deposits cause the intake flaps to stick; the plastic actuator cam can snap under stress.",
